  "id": "capd",
  "term": "CAPD",
  "definition": "CAPD stands for Cornell Assessment of Pediatric Delirium. It is a brief observational screen used in pediatric critical care to quickly look for signs of delirium by noting consciousness, thinking, orientation, movement, and emotional distress in critically ill patients from birth to age 21, including those with developmental delays.",
